{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/new-steam-gif_1.gif?t=1749541533\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME, UNIT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filthium Zero is a single-player action roguelite with a focus on verticality. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, take on hordes of mutants, engage in vertical and ground combat, and watch the ragdolls fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: purify water sources by extracting Filthium and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating the hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades their predecessors secured. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward \u2014 one soldier at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FAST-PACED GROUND &amp; VERTICAL COMBAT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your barrel from mid-air for a heavy impact, slam down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE SKULL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every UNIT is guided by a strange, floating skull \u2014 a persistent assistant who remembers every fallen UNIT. It knows more than you might expect and never leaves your side. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc80 DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3514090?t=1749541533","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/36cd9493ca8847327e9350a56c51fce3bc82bcf8/pa